      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19376/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook tomatoes and basil in a large saucepan over medium-low heat until tomatoes are soft.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_TqC31fBHxH0g4aRPs9P1ulWIgw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19376-fresh-tomato-basil-sauce-VAT-012-step-02-f7e7d8d62d7e4d87bb80a1497aecad1b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19376/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, heat olive oil in a medium skillet over medium heat; add onion and garlic and sauté until onion has softened and turned translucent, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rTl_l7aFnhU1151aDIJqVsCpzAg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19376-fresh-tomato-basil-sauce-VAT-013-step-03-9cf83c0604644344869d8affc917c1cb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19376/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add onion mixture to tomato mixture; season with salt and pepper. Simmer on low heat for 2 hours or until thick.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
